trait-luam-deafness-name = Deaf
trait-luam-deafness-desc = You hear no speech, no radio and almost no other sounds. A switched on hearing aid around the neck brings your hearing back until its power cell runs out.

trait-luam-ipc-faulty-hearing-sensors-name = Faulty Hearing Sensors
trait-luam-ipc-faulty-hearing-sensors-desc = Your hearing sensors pick up no speech, no radio and almost no other sounds. A switched on hearing sensor around the neck brings your hearing back until its power cell runs out.
